/T ("\\nConclusion:\\n\\nThis project explored the Student Performance datasetusingPyth on, Pandas,\\nNumPy, and Matplotlib to identify patterns and factorsassociatedwit h\\nstudents' academic performance. Through data cleaning, exploratorydata\\nanalys is \(EDA\), and data visualization, meaningful relationships between\\ndifferentvari ables and exam scores were identified.\\n\\nThe analysis indicatedthatfactorssuch as test preparation course completion,\\nparental level of education,andlunchtyp e were associated with differences\\nin student performance. Italsohighlighteda strong positive relationship\\namong reading and writing scoresandmathscores,sh owing how these academic skills are\\nclosely related.\\n\\nOverall,thisprojectstr engthened my understanding of data preprocessing,\\nexploratorydataanalysis,and data visualization techniques. It enhanced my\\nability to extractmeaningfulinsig hts from real-world datasets and communicate\\nthem effectivelyusingchartsandst atistical summaries.\\n\\nThis project serves as an important stepinmyDataAnalyt ics and Machine\\nLearning journey, providing a strong foundationformoreadvanced analytical\\nand predictive modeling projects in the future.\\n")
